# Input
```css
/* should not generate diagnostics */
/* `&:hover` resolves to a different selector in each block, so the two rules
   never target the same element and neither can override the other. */
.article-content a {
  color: var(--color-nothing-red);

  &:hover {
    border-bottom-color: var(--color-nothing-red);
  }
}

.blog-section__item {
  color: var(--color-text-primary);

  &:hover {
    padding-left: 0.75rem;
  }

  &:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }
}

```
